. *test if New US code sections (or subsections of those) from IRA authorize the grant
. *This text parsing identifies a section or subsection of the IRA US Code portions if the authorization description contains the exact text for the IRA section (ex. "26 US Code 4001"
> ) and if the charecter immediately after the search text is a non-nunmber (ie a space when the section is an exact match, or a letter when the authorization text is a subsection)
.  *this keeps the text parsing from getting a false positive, as if I searched for "26 US Code 21" and accepted "26 US Code 2101" as the same.
. 
. *The following list of US Code sections consists of every (1) new section or (2) preceeding or (3) new preceeding section created by the Inflation Reduction Act (Public Law 117-169)
. *https://uscode.house.gov/classification/tbl117pl_2nd.htm 
.  
. foreach section in "26 US Code 56A" "26 US Code 55" "26 US Code 4501" "26 US Code 4501" "26 US Code 4001" "42 US Code 1320f" "42 US Code 1320f-1" "42 US Code 1320f-2" "42 US Code 13
> 20f-3" "42 US Code 1320f-4" "42 US Code 1320f-5" "42 US Code 1320f-6" "42 US Code 1320f-7" "26 US Code 5000D" "26 US Code 5000D" "26 US Code 4001" "42 US Code 1395w-114b" "42 US Cod
> e 1395w-114c" "42 US Code 1395w-114d" "26 US Code 45U" "26 US Code 38" "26 US Code 40B" "26 US Code 38" "26 US Code 45V" "26 US Code 38" "26 US Code 21" "26 US Code 21" "26 US Code 
> 27" "26 US Code 25E" "26 US Code 21" "26 US Code 45W" "26 US Code 38" "26 US Code 45X" "26 US Code 38" "26 US Code 45Y" "26 US Code 38" "26 US Code 48E" "26 US Code 46" "26 US Code 
> 45Z" "26 US Code 38" "26 US Code 6417" "26 US Code 6418" "26 US Code 6411" "42 US Code 18795" "42 US Code 18795a" "42 US Code 18795b" "42 US Code 16517" "42 US Code 18715" "42 US Co
> de 18715a" "42 US Code 18715b" "42 US Code 17113b" "43 US Code 1356c" "30 US Code 1727" "43 US Code 3006" "42 US Code 7432" "42 US Code 7433" "42 US Code 7434" "42 US Code 7435" "42
>  US Code 7436" "42 US Code 7437" "42 US Code 7438" "23 US Code 177" "23 US Code 101" "23 US Code 178" "23 US Code 101" "23 US Code 179" "23 US Code 101" {
  2.         replace IRA_author = 1 if strpos(authorization040, "`section'") > 0 & 1 == regexm( substr( authorization 040, ( strpos(authorization040, "`section'") + strlen("`section'"
> ) ), 1 ) ,"[^0-9]")
  3. }
