. *This matches any BLS 4-digit NAICS code wiht the closest 2025 National Employment Matrix code (named NAICS_match). Prioirity is given first to the most granular matches, (ex. the f
> irst 4 of the matrix code matches the complete NAICS). Then, if there is no granular match, we look for the next most granular supergroup to which the NAICS belongs (like how NAICS 
> 4523 falls under matrix code 44-450). Our least granular matches in this file are the government jobs at the NAICS 9000 umbrella.
. 
